# Keep the build context small and reproducible.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.gradle
**/.svelte-kit
server/.gradle
server/build
web/node_modules
web/dist
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.DS_Store

# Deployment secrets and local env. The auth token reaches the container as a docker SECRET at
# runtime, never through the image — so it has no business in the build context either.
.env
secrets/
